-- Local development seed 4 of 4: clients, properties, cleaning jobs, assignments and feedback.
-- NEVER run against a hosted project.
-- Built from an anonymised copy of The Tidy Team Schedule workbook: every client, address, contact
-- and cleaner name is generated, notes are rewritten, and no phone number or email is kept. Only
-- dates, cleaning types, hours, rates, ratings and the company mix follow the original.
-- Needs 02_reference_data.sql and 03_roster.sql (companies, cleaners, cleaning types, statuses and
-- property types).
-- Fixed ids make it safe to run more than once. Past jobs are Done; jobs on or after 2026-11-27
-- are In Progress, Confirmed or Booked.

